  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Volumetric fog</b>\n<size=70%>The air as a medium: it dims what lies behind it and adds the light of real lights.\n\n1 \xB7 The halo in fog \xB7 2 \xB7 Shafts \xB7 3 \xB7 Height fog \xB7 4 \xB7 Fog in shadow\n\nOne Volume, <i>Volume - Fog (global)</i>, holds the fog for every station. A change made at one station shows at all of them: set it back when you are done.\n\n<size=80%><color=#C8C8C8>The fog comes from the URP Volumetric Fog package (com.cqf.urpvolumetricfog). Distance fog is in the Sky Room.</color></size></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: f6114514cd4f3864483c378c31dcaede, type: 2}
