  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Volumetric fog adds only the light of real Light components that reach the air, and only from lights with a Volumetric Additional Light component. Emission adds no light: an emissive surface stays a coloured surface.


    <b>Predict:</b> The neon halo stands in volumetric fog. Will the fog around it glow?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Switch on the Point Light behind the halo.

    2. On its Volumetric Additional Light component, change Scattering.

    3. Switch the component off and compare.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: References 02, 26, 28</color></size>'
